" [1] My Issues │ [2] Team Issues │ [3] Analytics │ [4] Cycles │ [5] Projects    "
"┌My Issues · group: workflow state · sort: active cycle, then priority─────────┐"
"│┌ Keys ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │"
"││ Move                                │ Edit the issue                      │ │"
"││  n,j      down / up                 │  s          workflow state          │ │"
"││  G,gb     top / bottom              │  a          assignee                │ │"
"││  C-d/C-u  half page                 │  p          priority                │ │"
"││  h/l      pane left / right         │  L          labels                  │ │"
"││  Esc      close or step back        │  e          estimate                │ │"
"││                                     │  C/P        cycle / project         │ │"
"││ Open & copy                         │  M/d        milestone / due date    │ │"
"││  Enter  open the issue              │  E          title and description   │ │"
"││  yi/yu  copy key / URL              │  c          comment                 │ │"
"││  yb/ym  copy branch / link          │  A/U        archive / unarchive     │ │"
"││  o      Linear page or PR           │  X/S        trash / subscribe       │ │"
"││  O      other links                 │             new issue               │ │"
"││  gr     related issue               │  H/Dp/R/Dr  parent / relations      │ │"
"││                                     │                                     │ │"
"││ App                                 │ Issue list                          │ │"
"│└ Esc close ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │"
"└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
" Move │ j/k move                                                                "
" Do   │ Esc close                                                               "
